## 📊 Prediction Output

![Prediction Output](assets/dashboard/prediction.png)

📌 **Insights:**

* Model provides churn probability along with prediction
* High-risk customers are clearly highlighted
* Includes actionable recommendations

---

## 📊 Model Performance

![Confusion Matrix](assets/model/confusion_matrix.png)

📌 **Insights:**

* High recall ensures most churn customers are captured
* Some false positives are acceptable for business use
* Helps reduce missed churn cases

---

## 📈 Classification Report

![Classification Report](assets/insights/classification_report.png)

📌 **Insights:**

* Recall for churn class is high
* Precision is moderate (expected trade-off)
* Balanced for business decision-making

---

## 🔍 Key Drivers of Churn

![Feature Importance](assets/eda/feature_importance.png)

📌 **Insights:**

* Contract type is the strongest churn driver
* Customers with low tenure are more likely to churn
* Lack of support services increases churn risk
* Higher monthly charges contribute to churn

