## ⚙️ Tech Stack

* Python
* Pandas, NumPy
* Scikit-learn
* Matplotlib, Seaborn
* Streamlit

---

## ⚡ Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/customer-churn-model.git
cd customer-churn-model
```

```bash
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate
```

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## ▶️ Usage

### Train Model

```bash
python src/train.py
```

Model is trained using `src/train.py`. Run the script to generate the model file.

### Run App

```bash
streamlit run app/app.py
```

---

## 🌐 Deployment

### 🚀 Streamlit Cloud

1. Push project to GitHub
2. Go to Streamlit Cloud
3. Select repo & deploy

---

### 🐳 Docker Deployment

```dockerfile
FROM python:3.10

WORKDIR /app
COPY . .

RUN pip install -r requirements.txt

CMD ["streamlit", "run", "app/app.py", "--server.port=8501", "--server.address=0.0.0.0"]
```

```bash
docker build -t churn-app .
docker run -p 8501:8501 churn-app
```

---

### ☁️ Cloud Options

* AWS EC2 / ECS
* GCP Cloud Run
* Azure App Services

